              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To access and manage your Wells Fargo credit card account online, you can use the main Wells Fargo Online Banking portal, which integrates all of your Wells Fargo accounts (including credit cards, checking, and savings). \n\n### How to Log In\n1. **Go to the Official Website:** Navigate to the secure [Wells Fargo Homepage](https://www.wellsfargo.com) or the dedicated [Wells Fargo Cardholders Page](https://www.wellsfargo.com/cardholders/).\n2. **Enter Your Credentials:** On the \"Sign On\" form, enter your **Username** and **Password**.\n3. **Click Sign On:** Click the **Sign On** button to access your account dashboard.\n\nOnce signed in, you will be able to view your credit card balance, see your transaction history, make payments, download statements, and set up autopay.\n\n---\n\n### First-Time Users (Enrollment)\nIf you have a new credit card and have not set up online access yet:\n1. Go to the [Wells Fargo Homepage](https://www.wellsfargo.com).\n2. Click on **Enroll** (located just below the Sign On fields).\n3. Provide your personal information, such as your credit card number, Social Security Number (SSN) or Individual Taxpayer Identification Number (ITIN), and date of birth.\n4. Create a unique username and password to complete your registration.\n\n---\n\n### Forgotten Username or Password\nIf you cannot remember your login details:\n* Click the **Forgot Username or Password?** link directly below the Sign On boxes on the homepage.\n* Follow the security prompts (you will need to verify your identity using your SSN/ITIN and your card or account number) to recover your username or reset your password.\n\n---\n\n### Alternative: Wells Fargo Mobile App\nYou can also manage your credit card securely on your smartphone or tablet:\n1. Download the **Wells Fargo Mobile\u00ae** app from the Apple App Store or Google Play Store.\n2. Open the app and log in using the same username and password you use for online banking.\n3. For faster and more secure future logins, you can enable biometric authentication (such as Face ID or Touch ID).\n\n---\n\n### \u26a0\ufe0f Security Reminders\n* **Verify the URL:** Always ensure the address bar in your browser starts with **`https://www.wellsfargo.com/`**. Look for the lock icon next to the URL to confirm it is a secure connection.\n* **Avoid Phishing:** Wells Fargo will never email or text you asking for your password, PIN, or full credit card details. \n* **Customer Support:** If you have trouble logging in or suspect fraudulent activity, call the customer service number on the back of your credit card.",
